* Thu Nov 19 2026 Brian G <justlostintime@gmail.com> 1.8.5
- inside the AppImage a sub run as a command (!sub | cat), runvar and @var(...) start the bundled gsh through the bundled gbr3, /usr/bin/gsh is not there on a system with only the AppImage
