- the AppImage is built for Ubuntu 24.04 with the Gambas master repository, dash is an AppImage dependency
- removed two Debug lines that printed when gsh was compiled with debug information
- clearsubs name works for a loaded sub, a word that names a sub is given to a sub run as a command as text, not as the Function
- the '' and ''' help lines of a sub or class typed at the prompt or defined in a script are kept, help showed no description and saving the sub lost them
- lclass help and the manual no longer call it lsub
- regression tests can be skipped with a name.skip file, the service mode test is skipped until it is finished

